{"5257200":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Jono","steam_appid":5257200,"required_age":0,"is_free":true,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jono is a tiny platformer hero with a very long road ahead: 1 000 000 levels. There is only one Jono in the whole world!<br><br>When it is your turn, you control it for one minute. Then the next person in the queue takes over from exactly where you left off.<br><br>As one user on Reddit put it: this game is <strong>Massively Singleplayer.<\/strong><br> <br><strong>Everybody else is watching! <\/strong> <br>While you wait, you see the current player playing it, in real time. Cheer, advise, or complain in the chat. Spam emotes. Make the talking head say something stupid. Join the conga line. <br> <br><strong>Nothing is lost!<\/strong>  <br>Death only resets the current room. Jono never goes backwards! Every room cleared by anyone is cleared for everyone, forever. Every death leaves a gravestone, so the next person knows exactly where not to jump.<strong> <\/strong>  <br>  <br><strong>The road is never the same!<\/strong>  <br>Stairs, spikes, crushers, ice, portals, puzzles, chasing spike walls, rooms in the dark, and rooms that turn the whole world sideways.  <br>  <br><strong>Build your own levels in the editor! <\/strong> <br>  <br>  <br>They're placed on the journey ahead, and at least ONE player needs to finish it.  <br>  <br>Earn chests by playing full of hats, trails, effects, and more. Catch the monkey when it peeks out. Send chests to other players if you want!  <br>  <br>- One shared character, one-minute turns, and a live spectator view   <br>- Progress is permanent, global and shared   <br>- Global chat, emotes and a talking head for the people who are waiting   <br>- 1 million levels - all unique   <br>- Hats and cosmetics, daily and weekly leaderboards  <br>  <br>What happens at the end..?<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jono is a tiny platformer hero with a very long roa